{title: Glory To His Name}
{key: G}
{x_theme: blood, cross, salvation}
{x_source: chrd:glory_to_his_name.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Down at the cross where my [C]Sav - ior [G]died,
[G]Down where for cleans - ing from sin I [D]cried;
[G]There to my heart was the [C]blood ap - [G]plied; Glory [D]to His [G]Name!

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Glory to His [G]na-a-ame, glory to His [D]na-a-ame!
[G]There to my heart was the [C]blood ap - [G]plied; Glory [D]to His [G]name!

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]I am so wond -rous -ly [C]saved from [G]sin,
[G]Je - sus so sweet - ly a - bides with -[D]in;
